~$*

# Generated PDF output (runtime temp dir + ad-hoc test artifacts)
app-backend/temp/
app-backend/test*.pdf

# Ad-hoc scratch/repro files in app-backend (underscore-prefixed):
# render dumps (_*.dxf/.png/.pdf), generator/repro scripts (_gen*.mjs, _*repro*.mjs,
# _pdfrender.py) and scratch text (_*.txt). Not part of the build — never committed.
app-backend/_*

# Large reference documents & sample data (kept on disk, not tracked)
# Root-level manuals, training material, sample survey plans
/*.pdf
/*.docx
# Reference dump folders (SI 727 regs, control-point data, screenshots, manuals).
# Patterns are anchored with a leading slash so they only match at the repo root —
# previously the bare `cadastral-standard/` also matched
# app-frontend/src/views/modules/cadastral-standard/, silently un-tracking the
# entire frontend module.
/cadastral-standard/
/sample docs/
